## 3. User Account Control

User Account Control was reviewed to determine whether applications require user approval when attempting to make administrative changes.

The system was configured to notify the user when applications attempt to make changes to the computer.

### Result

**Status: Appropriate**

The existing UAC configuration provides an additional layer of protection against unauthorized administrative changes.

