## 4. Local Administrator Privileges

Local user and group configuration was reviewed.

The local **Administrators** group contained:

* Chris
* Administrator

No unnecessary additional personal accounts were identified as members of the Administrators group during the assessment.

### Result

**Status: Reviewed**

Administrative privileges were reviewed as part of the endpoint security assessment.

---

## 5. Password Policy

The initial password policy contained several weak configurations.

### Before Hardening

| Policy                  | Initial Configuration |
| ----------------------- | --------------------- |
| Minimum password length | 0                     |
| Password complexity     | Disabled              |
| Maximum password age    | 42 days               |
| Password history        | 0 passwords           |

The minimum password length and password complexity settings provided insufficient password protection.

### Remediation

The following changes were applied:

| Policy                  | Final Configuration |
| ----------------------- | ------------------- |
| Minimum password length | 12 characters       |
| Password complexity     | Enabled             |
| Maximum password age    | 42 days             |
| Password history        | 5 passwords         |

### Result

**Status: Hardened**

The password policy was strengthened to require longer and more complex passwords while preventing immediate reuse of recently used passwords.

**Evidence:**

`04-password-policy-hardened.png`

